{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30480","headline":"经汾阳旧宅 · 赵嘏","name":"经汾阳旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门前不改旧山河，破虏曾轻马伏波。\n今日独经歌舞地，古槐疎冷夕阳多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《三体唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三體唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}